#. A menu row's value, shown at its right: keep it short (about 15 characters).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:6740
msgid "5 GB"
msgstr "5 GB"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6744
msgid "All the console's; Auto if the game says there is too little"
msgstr "Toda a da consola; Automático se o jogo disser que há pouca"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:6745
msgid "2 GB at most, so older games don't get confused"
msgstr "2 GB no máximo, para não confundir os jogos mais antigos"

#. A menu row's value, shown at its right: keep it short (about 15 characters).
#: title/pc5_ui.c:6746
msgid "Maximum"
msgstr "Máximo"

